            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s126",
                "printed_page": "49",
                "text": "מְכַלְכֵּל חַיִּים בְּחֶסֶד מְחַיֵּה מֵתִים בְּרַחֲמִים רַבִּים סוֹמֵךְ נוֹפְלִים וְרוֹפֵא חוֹלִים וּמַתִּיר אֲסוּרִים וּמְקַיֵּם אֱמוּנָתוֹ לִישֵׁנֵי עָפָר. מִי כָמוֹךָ בַּעַל גְּבוּרוֹת וּמִי דּוֹמֶה לָּךְ מֶלֶךְ מֵמִית וּמְחַיֶּה וּמַצְמִיחַ יְשׁוּעָה:",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/repetition/gevurot/mekhalkel/text",
            "source": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mekhalkel_chayyim"
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "paragraph": 1,
            "fragments": [
              {
                "scan": "s127",
                "printed_page": "49",
                "text": "Sustaining life with kindness, reviving the dead with great compassion, supporting the falling, healing the sick and releasing the captives and keeping His faith with those who sleep in the dust. Who is like Thee, Master of might, and who resembles Thee, O King, who slays and revives and causes salvation to spring forth.",
                "page_start": true
              }
            ],
            "corresp": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/shacharit/repetition/gevurot/mekhalkel/text",
            "source": "urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/gevurot/mekhalkel_chayyim"
          }
        ]
      }
